  "native_controls": "Unchanged v40; four phasing workers, 8 s fast, shared 180 s auto budget, 128 MiB dense model budget; seed 0. ",
  "comparator_priors": "Both receive identical Laue rotations and centring from the SHELXT INS; exact space group/counts/coordinates withheld. Native retains all metric settings with explicit prior-exclusion status.",
